@{ ViewData["Title"] = "About"; }
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="section-kicker">About the system</span><h1>Online examinations made easier to manage and take.</h1><p>The system brings exam creation, student access, monitoring and results into one place.</p></div></section>
<section class="public-section bg-white"><div class="container"><div class="row g-5 align-items-start"><div class="col-lg-6"><h2 class="fw-bold">Why this system was built</h2><p class="text-secondary fs-5">Teachers often use separate tools for questions, schedules, student lists, monitoring and results. This project combines those tasks in one clear workflow.</p><p class="text-secondary">Students receive a simple portal that shows what is available, what they need to do next and where to find their results.</p></div><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="about-principles"><div><i class="bi bi-signpost-split"></i><h5>Clear steps</h5><p>Every page focuses on one task and shows the next useful action.</p></div><div><i class="bi bi-person-lock"></i><h5>Role-based access</h5><p>Administrators, teachers and students see only the tools they are allowed to use.</p></div><div><i class="bi bi-eye"></i><h5>Human review</h5><p>AI observations keep their model details and evidence so an authorized person can review them before any final decision.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="public-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-kicker">Main technology</span><h2>Built with dependable web tools</h2><p>The application uses ASP.NET Core, Razor Pages, Entity Framework Core, SQL Server and separate local FastAPI AI services.</p></div><div class="row g-3 mt-2"><div class="col-md-4"><div class="tech-card"><i class="bi bi-code-square"></i><strong>ASP.NET Core 8</strong><span>Web pages, accounts and role-based security</span></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="tech-card"><i class="bi bi-cpu"></i><strong>Versioned AI services</strong><span>Face identity, behavior and multilingual speech integrated for review</span></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="tech-card"><i class="bi bi-database"></i><strong>SQL Server</strong><span>Exam, result and monitoring records</span></div></div></div></div></section>
